  Node:
  - sentences:
    - text: "Some crazies around here seem to think we\u2019re all just living in
        a simulation. HA! Can you believe that? How silly."
  - sentences:
    - text: "Sorry I have to go, but if you want to chat later\u2026 I\u2019ll be
        back."
  - sentences:
    - text: "PHEW! I just got done with a 20 kilometre run! I\u2019m exhausted!"
    - text: All I want to do now is just stand here and not move at all, so you know
        what I think I will.
    - text: Sorry, if you wanted to see me zooming around you just missed it.
